            {
              "id": "1774727305095_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate an InitSubtitle prompt by concatenating the following attributes from {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output}}:\nInclude each attribute only if its value is present.\n\nFormat each included attribute as \"Label: Value\" with the exact attribute paths as shown.\n\nAccount: <CustomerAccount.PartyUniqueName> (10-15 spaces)\nProducts: <ListOfRevenues.InventoryItemId.Name> (10-15 spaces)\nAmount: <PrimaryRevenue.RevnAmount> formatted with thousands separators (e.g., 1,234,567) (10-15 spaces)\nStage: <SalesStage.StgOrderEnum_localizedValue> (10-15 spaces)\nClose Date: <EffectiveDate> (date only, omit time, format as YYYY-MM-DD)\n\nEnsure each included attribute is separated by exactly 10 to 15 spaces.\n\nOmit the label and value entirely if the value is missing or empty.\n\nFor Close Date, include only the date part (e.g., YYYY-MM-DD), excluding the time portion."
            }
