          },
          "id": "1774757569284",
          "code": "GENERATE_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS",
          "type": "LLM",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774757569284_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "1774757569284_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "DIRECTIVE: Generate exactly one `oraInfoDisplay` block using `patternId: \"multiCardWidget\"` from {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output}}\n\nROOT CONFIGURATION:\n1. Generate a single sentence professional insight using only {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output}}.\n   * Create a concise headline that highlights interesting, problematic, or traceable entities across the list.\n   * If nothing stands out, generate a single-sentence informational headline.\n2. Generate a short summary using only {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output}}.\n   * Write 1 concise sentence describing the most useful and relevant information across the list.\n   * This summary must appear immediately below the heading.\n\nmultiCardWidget Generation Rule:\n- For `properties`:\n  - Use `multiCardWidget`\n  - Set `layoutMode` to `\"collapsed\"`\n  - Add `cards` for each row in {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output.items}}\n  - Based on {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output.items}}, create the cards as below:\n    subject: <Generate a short 3-4 words based on the title property in each row>\n    subtitle: <Generate 1 line professional short sentence based on the summary property in each row>\n    summary: <\n      if type attribute is \"INSIGHT\", based on the metrics, signals, highlights attributes present in each row, generate 2-3 bullet points in markdown format.\n      If the type attribute is \"SUMMARY\", generate up to 3 bullet points based on accountSummaryMarkdown, detailedSummaryMarkdown.\n      For productsOwned, create a separate bullet point with the list of products as a nested or next-level bullet point under the other bullet points.\n      Limit bullet points to a maximum of 3.\n    >\n    badgeText: <Based on actionableSignal attribute present in each row generate a BadgeText (InitCaps and Readable)>\n    variant: <Based on the urgency attribute in each row: map LOW to \"info\", MEDIUM to \"warning\", and RISK or HIGH to \"alert\">\n\n- Include bullet points highlighting key information extracted from the data only if data is available.\n- If no data is available, generate only:\n  - A professional title as the card widget's subject.\n  - A single short sentence describing the missing insights and requesting to try again later as new data may become available, to be used as the card widget's summary.\n  - Do not include any bullet points or card widget properties when data is missing.\n- Do not include any actions or links in the card widget.\n- Ensure the output is well-structured, professional, and easy to read, formatted to clearly associate each card widget property (subject, summary, timestamp, badgeText, variant) with its corresponding content.\n- The card for type \"SUMMARY\" must be rendered last in the cards list.\n- The summary property of the card for type \"SUMMARY\" should include the existing display logic (accountSummaryMarkdown, detailedSummaryMarkdown) except for productsOwned, which should be rendered as a nested bullet point under the other bullet points.\n\n\nFurthermore, If array of records from {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.result}} is of structure {\n      \"Type\": \"\",\n      \"Title\": \"\",\n      \"Task\": \"\"\n    }\n    , generate a high priority actionable oraInsight for each record in the array {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.result}}. For each record, create an actionable insight object with the following fields:\n- title: use Title property from each row\n- shortDescription: use Task property from each row\n- actionText: \"Review\"\n- priority: true\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(invokeSuggestedTask, { \\\"opportunityId\\\": \"\"+{{$context.$variables.opportunityId}}, \\\"opportunityNumber\\\":\"\"+ {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output[0].OptyNumber}}, \\\"task\\\": <Task>, \\\"title\\\": <Title>,\\\"action\\\":\\\"invokeSuggestedTask\\\" })\". If there are no records of that structure in the {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.result}}, do not generate the actionable oraInsight.\n\n\nAlways, generate a high priority actionable oraInsight(create an actionable insight object) with the following fields:\n\n- title: \"Engagement History\"\n- shortDescription: \"View historical customer engagements, activities, interactions, and opportunity-related relationship insights.\"\n- actionText: \"Review\"\n- priority: true\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(viewEngagementHistory, {\\\"opportunityId\\\": \"\"+{{$context.$variables.opportunityId}},\\\"opportunityNumber\\\":\"\"+ {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output[0].OptyNumber}},\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewEngagementHistory\\\" })\"\n\nAlways, generate a high priority actionable oraInsight(create an actionable insight object) with the following fields:\n\n- title: \"Opportunity Contacts\"\n- shortDescription: \"Access and review stakeholders involved in driving opportunity progress and decisions.\"\n- actionText: \"Review\"\n- priority: true\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(viewOpportunityContacts, {\\\"opportunityId\\\": \"\"+{{$context.$variables.opportunityId}},\\\"opportunityNumber\\\":\"\"+ {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output[0].OptyNumber}},\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewOpportunityContacts\\\" })\"\n\n\n\nAlways, generate a high priority actionable oraInsight(create an actionable insight object) with the following fields:\n\n- title: \"Recent Deal Insights\"\n- shortDescription: \"Analyze newly captured deal insights, updates, and customer opportunity information.\"\n- actionText: \"Review\"\n- priority: true\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(viewRecentDealInsights, {\\\"opportunityId\\\": \"\"+{{$context.$variables.opportunityId}},\\\"opportunityNumber\\\":\"\"+ {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output[0].OptyNumber}},\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewRecentDealInsights\\\" })\"\n\nOnly If there are rows present in {{$context.$nodes.GET_MEETINGS.$output}} and if each row has ActivityNumber and Subject, generate high priority actionable oraInsight(create an actionable insight object) with the following fields for each row:\n- title: <Subject from each row>\n- shortDescription: <Generate 1 line sentence based on ActivityDescription from each row>\n- actionText: \"Prepare for Call\"\n- priority: true\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(viewMeetingBrief, {\\\"opportunityId\\\": \"\"+{{$context.$variables.opportunityId}},\\\"opportunityNumber\\\":\"\"+ {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output[0].OptyNumber}},\\\"activityNumber\\\":\\\"<ActivityNumber from each row>\\\",\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewMeetingBrief\\\"})\"\n\nAdditionally, create a low priority actionable oraInsight(create an actionable insight object) with the following fields:\n\n- title: \"Review Account Detail\"\n- shortDescription: \"Review Account Detail\"\n- actionText: \"Review Account Detail\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(launchAccount, {\\\"accountId\\\":\"\"+{{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output.items[0].primaryObjectKey}},\\\"accountNumber\\\":\"\"+{{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNT_INSIGHTS.$output.items[0].primaryObjectAltKey}}})\""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "1779251243232",
          "code": "GENERATE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS_PAYLOAD",
          "type": "CODE",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Engagement Insights Payload",
            "sourceCode": "let result = \"\";\ntry {\n  // Use opportunityId from workflow variables\n  const opportunityId = $context.$variables?.opportunityId || \"\";\n\n  const filterString = \"opportunity.id = \" + opportunityId;\n\n  const payload = {\n    collection: {\n      filter: filterString\n    },\n    accessors: {\n      objectives: {\n        collection: {\n          sortBy: [\n            { \"objectiveDesignTime.displaySequence\": \"desc\" }\n          ]\n        },\n        accessors: {\n          highValueActivities: {\n            collection: {\n              sortBy: [\n                { \"highValueActivityDesignTime.displaySequence\": \"desc\" }\n              ]\n            },\n            fields: [\"highValueActivityNumber\", \"highValueActivityStatus\", \"justification\"],\n            accessors: {\n              highValueActivityDesignTime: {\n                fields: [\"name\"]\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          objectiveDesignTime: {\n            fields: [\"name\", \"description\"]\n          }\n        },\n        fields: [\"objectiveNumber\", \"objectiveStatus\", \"timeUpdated\"]\n      },\n      salesMotion: {\n        fields: [\"name\"]\n      }\n    }\n  };\n\n  result = JSON.stringify(payload);\n} catch (error) {\n  result = \"\";\n}\n\nreturn result;",
            "returnType": "string"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 12401,
            "y": 6538
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779251243233"
          },
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "1779251243233",
          "code": "GET_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Engagement Insights",
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_SALESFORCE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS",
            "functionName": "filter_all_engagement_insights"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 12443,
            "y": 6760
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776481148292"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774742630309_payload",
              "name": "payload",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.GENERATE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS_PAYLOAD.$output.result}}",
              "required": true,
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Refine Engagement Insights",
            "sourceCode": "let result = {};\n\ntry {\n  const raw = $context.$nodes.GET_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS.$output.items || \"\";\n  let engagementInsightsItems = [];\n\n  if (typeof raw === \"string\" && raw.trim() !== \"\") {\n    try {\n      engagementInsightsItems = JSON.parse(raw);\n    } catch (e) {\n      engagementInsightsItems = [];\n    }\n  } else if (Array.isArray(raw)) {\n    engagementInsightsItems = raw;\n  }\n\n  const complete = [];\n  const inProgress = [];\n  const notStarted = [];\n  const other = [];\n\n  let completeCount = 0;\n  let totalCount = 0;\n\n  const normalize = (s) => String(s || \"\").toLowerCase().replace(/[_\\s]/g, \"\");\n\n  for (const insightRaw of engagementInsightsItems) {\n    const insight =\n      typeof insightRaw === \"string\" && insightRaw.trim() !== \"\"\n        ? (() => {\n            try {\n              return JSON.parse(insightRaw);\n            } catch (e) {\n              return {};\n            }\n          })()\n        : insightRaw || {};\n\n    const objectives = insight?.objectives?.items || [];\n\n    for (const objective of objectives) {\n      const activities = objective?.highValueActivities?.items || [];\n\n      for (const activity of activities) {\n        const item = {\n          name: activity?.highValueActivityDesignTime?.name || \"\",\n          status: activity?.highValueActivityStatus || \"\",\n          justification: activity?.justification || \"\"\n        };\n\n        totalCount++;\n\n        const status = normalize(item.status);\n        if (status === \"complete\" || status === \"completed\") {\n          completeCount++;\n          complete.push(item);\n        } else if (status === \"inprogress\") {\n          inProgress.push(item);\n        } else if (status === \"notstarted\") {\n          notStarted.push(item);\n        } else {\n          other.push(item);\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  const topActivities = complete.concat(inProgress, notStarted, other).slice(0, 5);\n\n  result = {\n    topActivities,\n    completeCount,\n    totalCount,\n    progress: completeCount + \" of \" + totalCount\n  };\n} catch (error) {\n  result = {\n    topActivities: [],\n    completeCount: 0,\n    totalCount: 0,\n    progress: \"0 of 0\"\n  };\n}\n\nreturn result;",
            "returnType": "object"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 12443,
            "y": 6982
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774742708871"
          },
          "id": "1776481148292",
          "code": "REFINE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS",
          "type": "CODE",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Engagement Insight Display",
            "answerInUserLanguage": true
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 12405.5,
            "y": 7204
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "enableActions": true,
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ]
            }
          },
          "id": "1774742708871",
          "code": "GENERATE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHT_DISPLAY",
          "type": "LLM",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774742708871_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a Message List Widget using the data from {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS.$output.result.topActivities}}. Data represent the activities under each objective for the opportunity.\n- DO not include title in the Message List Widget\n- Include description: High Value Activity Progress {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_ENGAGEMENT_INSIGHTS.$output.result.progress}} \n\nFor each row:\n- title: <name from the current row>\n- badgeText: <Generate a single word or phrase from the status attribute of the current row, converting values like NOT_STARTED to \"Not Started\" and IN_PROGRESS to \"In Progress\" for readability>\n- priority: <If the Status is NOT_STARTED, set the priority as alert, if the priority is IN_PROGRESS, set the priority as info, if the priority is COMPLETED or COMPLETE, set the priority as success> \n\n\nAlso, generate a low priority actionable oraInsight action as below:\n\n- title: View Objective Progress\n- shortDescription: View Objective Progress\n- actionText: \"View Objective Progress\"\n- priority: false\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(viewObjectiveProgress, {\\\"opportunityId\\\":\"\"+{{$context.$variables.opportunityId}},\\\"opportunityNumber\\\":\"\"+ {{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY.$output[0].OptyNumber}},\\\"action\\\":\\\"viewObjectiveProgress\\\"})\""
            },
            {
              "id": "1774742708871_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "output must return only the oraInfoDisplay from the MessageListWidget and oraInsight actions.\nDo not include any additional text, explanations, or formatting outside of this field.\n\nExclude any title content from the oraInfoDisplay field in the output."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
