              "value": "Based on {{$context.$nodes.OPPORTUNITY_ASSISTANT_WORKFLOW.$output.output}} generate Markdown output as follows:\n\n- If the \"primaryText\" property exists and is non-empty, \n\n- If the \"secondaryText\" property exists and is non-empty, \n\n- Format the output of \"postback\" property using markdown syntax with paragraphs and bullet lists so it renders correctly in the UI.\n\n\nIf {{$context.$nodes.OPPORTUNITY_ASSISTANT_WORKFLOW.$output.output}} is empty or undefined, generate a single professional sentence stating:\n\"There are no insights available at this moment.\"\n\nDo not output any other content or text."
            }
          ]
        },
