          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779226891641_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "For each row in {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_ALL_OBJECTIVS.$output.result}}, generate a MessageListWidget.\n\nThe widget's title should be the row's index + 1 followed by the row's \"objectiveName\" property.\nDo not generate description for the widget.\n\nThe widget rows should come from the row's \"highValueActivities\" array.\n\n- Title: use highValueActivities[index].activityName\n- SubTitle: use highValueActivities[index].activityJustification\n- BadgeText: convert highValueActivities[index].activityStatus to a readable single word or phrase, mapping values like \"NOT_STARTED\" to \"Not Started\" and \"IN_PROGRESS\" to \"In Progress\". Represent this as badge. \n- Priority: If the highValueActivities[index].activityStatus  is NOT_STARTED, set the priority as alert, if the highValueActivities[index].activityStatus is IN_PROGRESS, set the priority as info, if the highValueActivities[index].activityStatus is COMPLETED or COMPLETE, set the priority as success\n\nEnsure the output clearly reflects these widgets for all rows in the input data."
            },
            {
              "id": "1779226891641_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Output must contains only oraInfoDisplay elements. Output Must not include description for the widget in oraInfoDisplay. No extra text."
            }
          ],
