              "id": "1779314148165_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Create a MessageListWidget with {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_ENGAGEMENTS.$output.result}}\n\nwidget title as: <Generate a concise summary of how many engagements happened>\nwidget description as: Create 2 line professional sentence based on the complete data set\n\nMessageListWidget row properties:\n\ntitle: <Description from each row>\nsubtitle: <if ChannelTypeCd is ORA_SVC_PHONE, display a Phone icon, else if ChannelTypeCd is ORA_SVC_EMAIL, display an Email icon>  <ContactPartyName from each row> : <ResolutionCdMeaning from each row>\nsummary: <if ChannelTypeCd is ORA_SVC_PHONE CallNotes from each row, else if ChannelTypeCd is ORA_SVC_EMAIL EmailNotes from each row>\nstatus: <Convert StartTime into the following user-friendly format:\n\nMMM DD - h:mm A\n\nExample:\n2026-05-02T17:25:16.721Z\n\nshould render as:\n\nMay 02 - 5:25 PM\n\nRules:\n\nUse abbreviated month name\nUse 12-hour time format\nInclude AM/PM\nRemove seconds, year, and timezone\nPreserve leading zero for date\nReturn the formatted string as the field value>\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "1779314148165_systemPrompt",
