        {
          "id": "1780961134046",
          "code": "MEETING_RESPONSE",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Meeting Response"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6509,
            "y": 7870
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780961134046_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use concise and clear language for each output section. Maintain all existing\nprompt template rules and expression formats as provided."
            },
            {
              "id": "1780961134046_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the outputs from APPOINTMENT_DETAILS Data - {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_DETAILS.$output}} and \nAPPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING Data - {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output}}, generate a detailed meeting \npreparation summary with the following structure:\n\n## Meeting Preparation\n- Use the 'Subject' field from the first element of APPOINTMENT_DETAILS output. - Mardown header level 1\n- Use the 'detailedAgenda' from APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING node's items[0].payload.what.facts.agenda.detailedAgenda.\n\nTime: <Format 'ActivityStartDate' from APPOINTMENT_DETAILS node into locale date and time with local timezone at end, e.g., \"Jan 20, 2026, Thursday 3:00PM PST\" or \n  \"January 20th, Thursday 3:00PM PST\".>\n- For location, use 'Location' from APPOINTMENT_DETAILS if present; otherwise, use 'ActivityDescription' location if \n  available; if neither, omit location.\n\n#### About <{{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.accountInsights.name}}>\n- Industry: {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.accountInsights.industry}}\n- Sentiment: {{\n  let s = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.accountInsights.sentiment;\n  s.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+s.slice(1)+\" sentiment: \" + $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.accountInsights.sentimentDescription\n}}\n- Products: {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.accountInsights.products}}\n\n\n#### \n{{\n  let opp = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.opportunityInsights;\n  let lead = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.leadInsights;\n  let data = opp || lead;\n  if(data){\n    let parts = [];\n    if(data.name) parts.push(data.name);\n    if(data.stage) parts.push(data.stage + (data.winProbability ? \"(\" + data.winProbability + \")\" : \"\"));\n    if(data.dealSize) parts.push(data.dealSize);\n    if(data.closeDate) parts.push(data.closeDate);\n    parts.join(\" | \");\n  }\n}} \n\n\n{{\n  let opp = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.opportunityInsights;\n  let lead = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.leadInsights;\n  let data = opp || lead;\n  if(data){\n    let details = [];\n    if(data.products) details.push(\"Products: \" + data.products);\n    if(data.keyStakeholder) details.push(\"Key Stakeholder: \" + data.keyStakeholder);\n    if(data.signals) details.push(\"Signals: \" + data.signals);\n    if(data.competitiveLandscape) details.push(\"Competitive Landscape: \" + data.competitiveLandscape);\n    details.join(\"\\n- \");\n  }\n}}\n\n#### Customer Attendees\n{{\n  let contacts = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.contactRelationship || [];\n  contacts.map(c => {\n    let sentiment = c.sentiment.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + c.sentiment.slice(1) + \" sentiment: \" + c.sentimentDescription;\n    let nameTitle = c.name + (c.jobTitle ? \" (\" + c.jobTitle + \")\" : \"\");\n    let influence = c.influenceLevel.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + c.influenceLevel.slice(1) + \" influence - \" + c.influenceDescription;\n    return `- ${nameTitle}\n  - ${sentiment}\n  - ${influence}\n  - Recent Engagement: ${c.recentEngagement || \"N/A\"}`;\n  }).join(\"\\n\")\n}}\n\n#### Pre-Meeting Checklist\n- {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.meetingStrategyAndRecommendations.preMeetingChecklist.join(\"\\n- \")}}\n\n#### Key Talking Points\n{{\n  let points = $context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.meetingStrategyAndRecommendations.talkingPoints || [];\n  points.map((p,i) => `${i+1}. ${p}`).join(\"\\n\")\n}}\n\n#### Objection Handling\n- {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.meetingStrategyAndRecommendations.objectionHandling.join(\"\\n- \")}}\n\n#### Intended Outcome\n- {{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.meetingStrategyAndRecommendations.intendedOutcome.join(\"\\n- \")}}\n\n#### Recent Engagement Summary\n{{$context.$nodes.APPOINTMENT_INSIGHTS_FOR_MEETING.$output.items[0].payload.what.facts.recentEngagementSummary}}\n\nEnsure all markdown formatting is correct and omit any sections or fields if data is missing. Maintain proper spacing between sections without excessive blank lines.  "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1781030682920",
          "code": "PAYLOAD_FOR_DUPLICATE_CHECK",
          "type": "CODE",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Payload for duplicate check",
            "sourceCode": "let result = {};\ntry {\n  // Safely access the email address from the upstream node output\n  let emailAddress = $context.$nodes?.RETRIEVE_THE_OPTY_PARAMETERS?.$output?.result?.emailAddress || \"\";\n\n  // Construct the payload object\n  result = {\n    entity: \"Contact\",\n    limit: 20,\n    skipInValidFields: true,\n    fields: [\n      \"PartyNumber\",\n      \"PersonFirstName\",\n      \"PersonLastName\",\n      \"PartyName\",\n      \"JobTitle\",\n      \"ContactRollup\",\n      \"ContactRollup.LastCompletedActivity\"\n    ],\n    sort: [\n      { attribute: \"ContactRollup.LastCompletedActivity\", direction: \"descending\" },\n      { attribute: \"CreationDate\", direction: \"ascending\" }\n    ],\n    q: {\n      op: \"$and\",\n      criteria: [\n        {\n          op: \"$eq\",\n          attribute: \"ListOfEmails.EmailAddress\",\n          value: emailAddress\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  };\n} catch (error) {\n  // Return empty object on error\n  result = {};\n}\n\nreturn result;\n",
            "returnType": "object"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8378,
            "y": 7204
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1781030774009"
          },
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
        },
