        {
          "id": "1781031127087",
          "code": "GENERATE_SIMILAR_CONTACTS",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Similar Contacts"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8379.5,
            "y": 7648
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1781031127087_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given the input data from {{$context.$nodes.GET_DUPLICATE_CONTACTS.$output}}, which contains an \"items\" array of contact rows, generate a message list widget.\n\nWidget title: Select Contact\nWidget description: <Based on {{$context.$nodes.GET_DUPLICATE_CONTACTS.$output}}, if there are rows, generate a concise professional sentence to select from the matching rows. If there are no rows, generate a concise professional sentence mentioning about no Duplicates and add the contact to opportunity>\n\nIf there is at least one row in \"items\", create a list item for each row with the following properties:\n- title: use the \"PartyName\" field from the current row\n- subtitle: use the \"JobTitle\" field from the current row (if null, leave empty)\n- additionalAction: an object with:\n  - text: \"Create Contact\"\n  - command: a string formatted as ora.Invoke(\"addContact\", {\"PartyNumber\":\"<PartyNumber>\",\"PartyName\":\"<PartyName>\",\"action\":\"addContact\"}) where <PartyNumber> and <PartyName> are from the current row\n\nIf there are no rows on {{$context.$nodes.GET_DUPLICATE_CONTACTS.$output}}, produce the widget row based on {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_THE_OPTY_PARAMETERS.$output.result}}. \n- title: concat the \"firstName\" field and \"lastName\" field\n- subtitle: use the \"EmailAddress\" field from the current row (if null, leave empty)\n- additionalAction: an object with:\n  - text: \"Create Contact\"\n  - command: a string formatted as ora.Invoke(\"addContact\", {\"PartyNumber\":\"<PartyNumber>\",\"PartyName\":\"<lastName firstName>\",\"FirstName\":\"<firstName>\",\"LastName\":\"<lastName>\",\"EmailAddress\":\"<emailAddress>\",\"action\":\"addContact\"}) \n\n\nEnsure the output is a valid message list widget structure only."
            },
            {
              "id": "1781031127087_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "output must return only the oraInfoDisplay from the MessageListWidget only.\nDo not include any additional text, explanations, or formatting outside of this field."
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "enableActions": true,
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1781033815382",
          "code": "CREATE_FIELDS_FOR_ADD_CONTACT",
          "type": "CODE",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Create fields for Add Contact",
            "sourceCode": "let result = [];\ntry {\n  // Safely access partyName from upstream node output\n  const partyName = $context.$nodes?.RETRIEVE_THE_OPTY_PARAMETERS?.$output?.result?.partyName || \"\";\n  const emailAddress = $context.$nodes?.RETRIEVE_THE_OPTY_PARAMETERS?.$output?.result?.emailAddress || \"\";\n  result = [\n    { id: \"partyName\", type: \"text\", label: \"Name\", value: partyName },\n    { id: \"phone\", type: \"text\", label: \"Phone\", value: \"\" },\n    { id: \"emailAddress\", type: \"text\", label: \"Email\", value: emailAddress },\n    {\n      id: \"primaryContact\",\n      type: \"select\",\n      label: \"Primary Contact\",\n      value: \"N\",\n      options: [\n        { value: \"Y\", label: \"Yes\" },\n        { value: \"N\", label: \"No\" }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      id: \"doNotCall\",\n      type: \"select\",\n      label: \"Do Not Call\",\n      value: \"N\",\n      options: [\n        { value: \"Y\", label: \"Yes\" },\n        { value: \"N\", label: \"No\" }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      id: \"doNotEmail\",\n      type: \"select\",\n      label: \"Do Not Email\",\n      value: \"N\",\n      options: [\n        { value: \"Y\", label: \"Yes\" },\n        { value: \"N\", label: \"No\" }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      id: \"action\",\n      type: \"system\",\n      value: \"createContact\"\n    },\n    {\n      id: \"systemPartyNumber\",\n      type: \"system\",\n      value: $context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_THE_OPTY_PARAMETERS.$output.result.partyNumber\n    }\n  ];\n} catch (error) {\n  result = [];\n}\n\nreturn result;",
            "returnType": "array"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8835.5,
            "y": 7204
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1781034567412"
          },
